      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so if the p-value is just telling me about the likelihood of the result being a fluke, how do i actually write this up in my discussion chapter? i want to make sure i address the \"noise\" or the potential for error without sounding like i'm questioning the validity of my whole study. how should i frame the limitations regarding the uncertainty in that confidence interval?",
